reply:
Here is a clean, interactive user interface built using the components in the catalog. 

This design uses a **Segmented Control** at the top to allow the user to easily filter the items by status, followed by a **Form Select** dropdown for mobile-friendly or alternative filter interaction. The items are rendered dynamically using an **Entity List** which natively supports a name (title), status indicator, and subtitle metadata (one-line detail) for each item.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "item-filter-surface",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json",
    "sendDataModel": true
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "item-filter-surface",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 1,
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "header",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Item Registry & Status Tracker"
